#: docs/development.rst:2
msgid "Documentation and development"
msgstr "文档与开发"

#: docs/development.rst:5
msgid "Build the documentation"
msgstr "构建文档"

#: docs/development.rst:7
msgid ""
"Install the C++ SDK and select ``MECHEYE_SDK_ROOT`` as described in "
":doc:`installation`. The documentation uses real imports, including dynamically "
"generated descriptors and containers. It does not construct or connect a camera."
msgstr ""
"按 :doc:`installation` 安装 C++ SDK 并设置 "
"``MECHEYE_SDK_ROOT``。文档构建真实导入包，包括动态生成的描述符和容器，但不会构造相机或连接设备。"

#: docs/development.rst:17
msgid ""
"Open ``docs/_build/en/index.html`` or ``docs/_build/zh_CN/index.html``. Sphinx "
"generates API indexes and autosummary pages under ``docs/api/_generated/``; these are"
" build products and are not committed. Update docstrings in ``src/mecheye/`` to "
"change the API reference. Dynamic value, array, and descriptor documentation is "
"attached by their factories."
msgstr ""
"打开 ``docs/_build/en/index.html`` 或 ``docs/_build/zh_CN/index.html``。Sphinx 在 "
"``docs/api/_generated/`` 下生成 API 索引和 autosummary 页面；这些构建产物不提交到版本库。修改 ``src/mecheye/``"
" 中的文档字符串可更新 API 参考；动态值、数组和描述符的文档由对应工厂函数附加。"

#: docs/development.rst:22
msgid ""
"The build treats warnings and unresolved references as errors and rejects missing "
"public docstrings. GitHub Actions runs the same build and saves the HTML as a "
"workflow artifact for review. English and Simplified Chinese use the same source "
"pages and public docstrings; API identifiers, signatures, and code examples remain "
"unchanged between languages."
msgstr ""
"构建将警告和无法解析的引用视为错误，并拒绝缺少公开文档字符串的接口。GitHub Actions 执行相同构建，保存 HTML "
"作为可供审查的工作流产物。英文和简体中文共用源页面及公开文档字符串；API 标识、签名和代码示例在两种语言中保持一致。"

#: docs/development.rst:29
msgid "Maintain translations"
msgstr "维护翻译"

#: docs/development.rst:31
msgid ""
"Chinese gettext catalogs live in ``docs/locale/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/``. After editing "
"the English guides or docstrings, extract messages and update the catalogs:"
msgstr "中文 gettext 翻译目录位于 ``docs/locale/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/``。修改英文指南或文档字符串后，请提取消息并更新翻译目录："

#: docs/development.rst:39
msgid ""
"Fill in new ``msgstr`` entries in the ``.po`` files, preserving reStructuredText "
"roles and links. Then run the check and rebuild both languages:"
msgstr "填写 ``.po`` 文件中新条目的 ``msgstr``，保留 reStructuredText 角色和链接。然后执行检查并重新构建两种语言："

#: docs/development.rst:46
msgid ""
"CI rejects missing, empty, fuzzy, or obsolete translations. Sphinx compiles ``.po`` "
"files automatically; generated ``.pot`` and ``.mo`` files are build artifacts. See "
"the `Sphinx translation guide <https://www.sphinx-"
"doc.org/en/master/usage/advanced/intl.html>`_ for the gettext workflow."
msgstr ""
"CI 会拒绝缺失、空白、模糊匹配或过期的翻译。Sphinx 自动编译 ``.po`` 文件；生成的 ``.pot`` 和 ``.mo`` 文件属于构建产物。gettext"
" 工作流程见 `Sphinx translation guide <https://www.sphinx-"
"doc.org/en/master/usage/advanced/intl.html>`_。"

#: docs/development.rst:53
msgid "Read the Docs"
msgstr "Read the Docs"

#: docs/development.rst:55
msgid ""
"The repository's ``.readthedocs.yaml`` uses Ubuntu and Python 3.12. It downloads and "
"verifies SDK 2.6.0 outside the checkout, builds the extension with the locked "
"``docs`` dependencies, and runs the strict Sphinx build. SDK files are not added to "
"the source distribution or HTML artifacts."
msgstr ""
"仓库的 ``.readthedocs.yaml`` 使用 Ubuntu 和 Python 3.12，在检出目录之外下载并校验 SDK 2.6.0，使用锁定的 "
"``docs`` 依赖编译扩展，并执行严格的 Sphinx 构建。SDK 文件不会加入源码分发包或 HTML 产物。"

#: docs/development.rst:60
msgid "To activate hosted publishing once:"
msgstr "首次启用托管发布："

#: docs/development.rst:62
msgid "Sign in to `Read the Docs <https://app.readthedocs.org/>`_ using GitHub."
msgstr "使用 GitHub 登录 `Read the Docs <https://app.readthedocs.org/>`_。"

#: docs/development.rst:63
msgid "Install/authorize the Read the Docs GitHub App for ``slabpanic/pymecheye``."
msgstr "为 ``slabpanic/pymecheye`` 安装／授权 Read the Docs GitHub App。"

#: docs/development.rst:64
msgid "Import that repository and set the project slug to ``pymecheye``."
msgstr "导入该仓库，将项目标识设置为 ``pymecheye``。"

#: docs/development.rst:65
msgid ""
"Set the default branch to ``main`` and activate any release-tag versions you want to "
"publish as stable documentation."
msgstr "将默认分支设置为 ``main``，并激活需要作为稳定文档发布的 release tag 版本。"

#: docs/development.rst:67
msgid ""
"Import the same repository again as ``pymecheye-zh-cn``, choose Simplified Chinese as"
" its language, and activate the same branch and release versions."
msgstr "再次导入同一仓库，项目标识为 ``pymecheye-zh-cn``，语言选择简体中文，并激活相同的分支与 release 版本。"

#: docs/development.rst:69
msgid "Add ``pymecheye-zh-cn`` under the parent project's **Translations** settings."
msgstr "在父项目的 **Translations** 设置中添加 ``pymecheye-zh-cn``。"

#: docs/development.rst:70
msgid "Enable pull request builds on both projects if previews are desired."
msgstr "如需预览，在两个项目中启用 pull request 构建。"

#: docs/development.rst:72
msgid ""
"The GitHub integration triggers builds after pushes. The ``latest`` version tracks "
"the default branch; activated release versions can also be published. The intended "
"URLs are ``https://pymecheye.readthedocs.io/en/latest/`` and "
"``https://pymecheye.readthedocs.io/zh-cn/latest/``. The shared configuration selects "
"Sphinx's language from ``READTHEDOCS_LANGUAGE`` in each project. If the slug is "
"already taken, update the documentation links and ``html_baseurl`` to the allocated "
"project slug. No Read the Docs API token is required in GitHub Actions."
msgstr ""
"GitHub 集成会在推送后触发构建。``latest`` 跟踪默认分支；激活的 release 版本也可以发布。预期地址为 "
"``https://pymecheye.readthedocs.io/en/latest/`` 和 ``https://pymecheye.readthedocs.io"
"/zh-cn/latest/``。共享配置从各项目的 ``READTHEDOCS_LANGUAGE`` 选择 Sphinx 语言。如果项目标识已被占用，请将文档链接和 "
"``html_baseurl`` 更新为实际分配的标识。GitHub Actions 不需要 Read the Docs API token。"

#: docs/development.rst:80
msgid ""
"This setup uses the Read the Docs webhook integration for publication; the GitHub "
"Actions documentation job validates HTML and does not upload to a separate hosting "
"service. See the `Read the Docs integration guide "
"<https://docs.readthedocs.com/platform/stable/reference/git-integration.html>`_ for "
"account and repository integration details."
msgstr ""
"此配置通过 Read the Docs webhook 集成发布；GitHub Actions 文档任务校验 HTML，不会上传到其他托管服务。账号与仓库集成细节见 "
"`Read the Docs integration guide "
"<https://docs.readthedocs.com/platform/stable/reference/git-integration.html>`_。"

#: docs/development.rst:87
msgid "Tests and coverage"
msgstr "测试与覆盖率"

#: docs/development.rst:96
msgid ""
"Tests cover SDK status and data operations with native containers and simulated "
"device responses. They do not require a camera. CI tests regular and free-threaded "
"Python, verifies source-distribution installation, and generates Python and C++ "
"coverage reports. Native coverage requires GCC on Linux and the "
"``MECHEYE_ENABLE_COVERAGE`` CMake option. Codecov uploads use OIDC."
msgstr ""
"测试使用原生容器和模拟设备响应，覆盖 SDK 状态与数据操作，无需相机。CI 测试普通与 free-threaded Python，验证源码分发包安装，并生成 "
"Python 与 C++ 覆盖率报告。原生覆盖率要求 Linux 下的 GCC，以及 CMake 选项 "
"``MECHEYE_ENABLE_COVERAGE``。Codecov 上传使用 OIDC。"

